ite british  iranian duel national mr ashuri with his  family  our embassy in tehran continues to  request consular access  we're in close contact with his family  and continue to support them  anusha is one of several british  iranians held in iran  taken as hostages by the iranian  government say supporters  to give it leverage in negotiations with  britain  the assures say the uk must do more to  help bring anusha home  before it's too late someone innocent is  in  a great deal of distress and his voice  is not being heard  and if something isn't done  soon it could be at the risk of his  sanity or even his life  dominic waghorn sky news
 

